#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:2
msgid "Parameters and Parameter Contracts"
msgstr "参数与参数契约"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:4
msgid "This page documents the canonical parameter-management API used by RELIC. `UnifiedParameterManager` is the only concrete parameter manager. It owns parameter lookup, validation, persistence, unit conversion, trainable parameters, caching, and snapshots. `ParameterSpec` is the canonical metadata contract for one parameter."
msgstr "本页记录 RELIC 使用的 canonical parameter-management API。`UnifiedParameterManager` 是唯一的具体 parameter manager，负责参数查找、验证、持久化、单位转换、可训练参数、缓存和 snapshot。`ParameterSpec` 是单个参数的 canonical metadata contract。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:11
msgid "There is no importable class named `ParameterManager`. In architecture prose, that name denotes the parameter-management role. Python code obtains the process-wide `UnifiedParameterManager` with `get_global_manager()`. Constructing `UnifiedParameterManager(...)` directly creates an independent manager, which must be injected explicitly where it is used."
msgstr "不存在名为 `ParameterManager` 的可导入类。架构说明中的这一名称表示参数管理职责。Python 代码通过 `get_global_manager()` 获取进程级的 `UnifiedParameterManager`。直接构造 `UnifiedParameterManager(...)` 会创建独立管理器，使用时必须显式注入。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:17
msgid "Scientific `FunctorBase` subclasses must not call the global manager directly. They retrieve values only through `self.get_parameter_value(\"key\", required=...)`. Non-Functor infrastructure uses `get_global_manager().get(...)`."
msgstr "科学 `FunctorBase` 子类不得直接调用 global manager。它们只能通过 `self.get_parameter_value(\"key\", required=...)` 获取值。非 Functor 基础设施使用 `get_global_manager().get(...)`。"

