#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:123
msgid "Each construction builds a new, independent manager; the class has no singleton hook. The process-wide manager is obtained only through `get_global_manager()`, and normal application code should use it. Code that needs a separate owner constructs one and injects it explicitly, for example through the `parameter_manager` argument of a Functor. An injected manager must expose `database`, its `ParameterDatabase`: dotted-name resolution in `FunctorBase.get_parameter_value()` and in the external coupling adapters calls `relic.parameters.namespaces.is_declared_namespace(namespace, manager)`, which asks `manager.database.declares_namespace(...)`. An independent manager never rewrites the process-wide variable name mapper."
msgstr "每次构造都会创建新的独立管理器；该类没有单例钩子。进程级管理器只能通过 `get_global_manager()` 获取，普通应用代码应使用它。需要独立所有者的代码应自行构造并显式注入，例如通过 Functor 的 `parameter_manager` 参数。注入的管理器必须公开 `database`，即其 `ParameterDatabase`：`FunctorBase.get_parameter_value()` 和外部耦合适配器中的点分名称解析会调用 `relic.parameters.namespaces.is_declared_namespace(namespace, manager)`，后者查询 `manager.database.declares_namespace(...)`。独立管理器绝不重写进程级变量名映射器。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:134
msgid "Under the default packaged database (`relic\\parameters\\database`), `138` YAML files define `4,751` leaf entries (`134` native `relic` tier files with `4,642` entries and `4` `calibrated` tier files with `109` entries), resolving after tier precedence to `4,643` active runtime parameters (`810` learnable parameters with `requires_grad=True`). Two distinct precedence rules govern resolution: inside `ParameterDatabase`, later tiers override earlier tiers in the order `relic`, enabled `calibrated` scopes (`global`, `regional`, `site_specific`), and `add_source(...)` paths; inside a Functor, `FunctorBase.get_parameter_value(..., source_order=(\"manager\", \"config\"))` queries `\"manager\"` (`UnifiedParameterManager`) before `\"config\"` (Functor-local overrides) by default."
msgstr "在默认随包数据库（`relic\\parameters\\database`）下，`138` 个 YAML 文件共定义 `4,751` 个叶条目（`134` 个原生 `relic` 层文件含 `4,642` 个条目，`4` 个 `calibrated` 层文件含 `109` 个条目），按层级优先级解析后得到 `4,643` 个有效运行时参数（其中 `810` 个设置 `requires_grad=True` 的可学习参数）。参数解析受两套独立的优先级规则治理：在 `ParameterDatabase` 内部，后加载层按 `relic`、已启用的 `calibrated` 作用域（`global`、`regional`、`site_specific`）以及 `add_source(...)` 路径的顺序覆盖先前层；在 Functor 内部，`FunctorBase.get_parameter_value(..., source_order=(\"manager\", \"config\"))` 默认先查询 `\"manager\"`（`UnifiedParameterManager`），再查询 `\"config\"`（Functor 局部覆盖项）。"

