#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:218
msgid "Updates a value, optionally validates it, invalidates affected caches, and notifies registered observers. `key` must name a registered parameter (loaded or in the database): an unknown key raises `KeyError` and changes nothing, so a misspelled key never becomes a new parameter. A new parameter is registered first with `register_parameter(...)`. Validation failures raise `ValueError`. Out-of-bounds behavior is controlled by `BoundsPolicy` and the manager's validation configuration; an invalid `RELIC_BOUNDS_POLICY` or `RELIC_UNIT_VALIDATION_MODE` environment value raises `ValueError` when the manager is created. `units` names the unit of `value`: the value is converted into the declared unit of the specification, which is never replaced; the dimensionless aliases `\"1\"` and `\"dimensionless\"` need no conversion, and a pair the unit owner cannot convert raises `ValueError` without writing. `set_batch(updates, validate=True, notify=True)` commits the whole batch (or restores every owner on a failure), then notifies every changed key; callback failures of all keys are raised together as one `ExceptionGroup` afterwards, and the changes stay committed."
msgstr "更新数值，可选地执行验证，使相关缓存失效，并通知已注册观察者。`key` 必须指定已注册参数（已加载或存在于数据库）：未知键会抛出 `KeyError` 且不改变任何内容，因此拼错的键不会成为新参数。新参数须先通过 `register_parameter(...)` 注册。验证失败抛出 `ValueError`。越界行为由 `BoundsPolicy` 和管理器的验证配置控制；`RELIC_BOUNDS_POLICY` 或 `RELIC_UNIT_VALIDATION_MODE` 环境变量值无效时，创建管理器会抛出 `ValueError`。`units` 指定 `value` 的单位：数值转换为规范声明的单位，不会替换该单位；无量纲别名 `\"1\"` 和 `\"dimensionless\"` 无须转换，单位所有者无法转换的单位对会抛出 `ValueError`，不执行写入。`set_batch(updates, validate=True, notify=True)` 提交整个批次（失败时恢复所有所有者），再通知每个发生变化的键；所有键的回调失败随后合并为一个 `ExceptionGroup` 抛出，已提交的修改保留。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:242
msgid "Persists one complete specification to the database tier and sets that parameter's specification, stored value and live binding together; no other specification is loaded into the manager. An existing binding of the same shape and dtype keeps its `nn.Parameter` object, gradient flag, and device and takes the new value in place; a specification that is no longer learnable loses its binding. A learnable specification without a tensor form raises `TypeError` before anything is written. `spec` must be a `ParameterSpec`; otherwise `TypeError` is raised. Loading the whole database (`preload_all`, a new `database_path`) gives every specification its stored value and every learnable specification its binding in the same way."
msgstr "将单份完整规范持久化至数据库层，并同步设置该参数的规范、存储值与实时绑定；不向管理器加载任何其他规范。形状与 dtype 相同的既有绑定保留其 `nn.Parameter` 对象、梯度标志与所在设备，并原地写入新值；不再可学习的规范则移除其绑定。无张量表示的可学习规范会在执行任何写入前抛出 `TypeError`。`spec` 必须是 `ParameterSpec` 实例，否则抛出 `TypeError`。加载整个数据库（如 `preload_all` 或切换至新 `database_path`）时，按同一规则为每份规范赋予存储值并为每份可学习规范建立绑定。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:257
msgid "Registers a specification in the existing manager and storage layer. This is a lower-level registration operation used by database and extension loading. It does not create another parameter owner. `register_parameter` and `set_parameter(spec, tier)` use the same `bind_learnable_value` rule, including database re-registration: matching shape and dtype preserve the live binding object, gradient flag, and device and copy the value in place. Changed shape or dtype creates a new binding; a non-learnable specification has none. `set_parameter` requires the destination `tier` explicitly."
msgstr "在现有管理器和存储层注册规范。这是数据库和扩展加载使用的底层注册操作，不创建第二个参数所有者。`register_parameter` 和 `set_parameter(spec, tier)` 使用同一 `bind_learnable_value` 规则，数据库重新注册也不例外：形状与 dtype 相同时保留实时绑定对象、梯度标志和设备，并原地复制数值；形状或 dtype 改变则创建新绑定，不可学习规范不具有绑定。`set_parameter` 要求显式指定目标 `tier`。"

