#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:310
msgid "These methods expose and migrate the manager-owned PyTorch parameters. Device assignment of scientific Functors remains owned by the simulator device policy; this API does not authorize a scientific module to select its own device."
