#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:324
msgid "The manager snapshot keeps each owner of parameter state apart and exactly as it is: `parameters` holds the serialized specifications with their declared values (type and dtype kept), `storage_snapshot` the storage's own snapshot of the stored values (a specification whose value is not stored yet stays without one), `nn_values` a copy of every live learnable `nn.Parameter` value (an optimizer may have moved it away from the declared value) and `nn_requires_grad` its gradient flag, next to the device, the validation settings and the unit issues. `restore()` validates the whole snapshot before it changes anything: it requires a `parameters` mapping, stored values that agree with their specifications, gradient flags only for learnable specifications, and one live value per flag with the shape and dtype of its specification; otherwise it raises `ValueError`. It then restores the stored values, the specifications, the live values (copied into the existing bindings, across devices, without replacing them; bindings created after the snapshot are removed) and the settings, so every value with its type and dtype, and every specification, equals its state at snapshot time."
msgstr "管理器快照分别原样保存各参数状态所有者的内容：`parameters` 保存序列化规范及声明值（保留类型和 dtype），`storage_snapshot` 保存存储层自身的存储值快照（尚未存储值的规范仍不具有存储值），`nn_values` 保存每个实时可学习 `nn.Parameter` 值的副本（优化器可能已使其偏离声明值），`nn_requires_grad` 保存其梯度标志，并同时记录设备、验证设置和单位问题。`restore()` 在改变任何内容之前验证整个快照：要求有 `parameters` 映射，存储值与规范一致，梯度标志仅对应可学习规范，且每个标志都有一个形状和 dtype 与规范一致的实时值；否则抛出 `ValueError`。随后恢复存储值、规范、实时值和设置；实时值可跨设备复制到原有绑定而不替换对象，快照之后创建的绑定会移除。恢复后，每个值及其类型和 dtype、每份规范均与快照时一致。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:341
msgid "`create_snapshot()` captures every parameter's value exactly (its stored value, or its declared value while none is stored) and the live learnable values in `metadata[\"nn_values\"]`; `restore_snapshot()` writes those values back, without validation, clamping or conversion, to the parameters that still exist and copies the live values into their bindings. Parameters registered after the snapshot are kept. `get_diff()`, `diff()` and the experiment diff compare resolved values: the live learnable value over the stored or declared value, which is the value `manager.get(...)` returns."
msgstr "`create_snapshot()` 精确捕获每个参数的值（已存储的值；未存储时为声明值），并将实时可学习值保存于 `metadata[\"nn_values\"]`；`restore_snapshot()` 将这些值原样写回仍存在的参数，不验证、裁剪或转换，同时将实时值复制到相应绑定。快照之后注册的参数保留。`get_diff()`、`diff()` 和实验差异比较都使用解析后的值：实时可学习值优先于存储值或声明值，也就是 `manager.get(...)` 返回的值。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:350
msgid "Global manager functions"
msgstr "Global manager 函数"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:352
msgid "`get_global_manager()`"
msgstr "`get_global_manager()`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:361
msgid "Returns the process-wide canonical manager. The first call creates it under a reentrant lock, calls `initialize()`, and refreshes the process-wide variable name mapper from it; if either step fails, the global manager is reset and the error is raised. Later calls return the same object; a later call with `preload_all=True` preloads it when it was not preloaded. Such a late preload adopts the database specifications of the keys the manager does not hold yet; a key it already holds (loaded on demand, registered, or written with `set_value`) keeps its specification, stored value and live binding. `initialize()` loads nothing: a manager constructed with `preload_all=True` holds the whole database when its constructor returns, and a value written or a learnable binding moved before `initialize()` is kept. A database switch (`configure` with a new `database_path`) unit-checks every specification of the new database under the manager's unit validation mode (check-only records an issue, strict raises before anything is adopted), replaces the held specifications, stored values and binding values with those of the new database, then clears the query cache and the unit-conversion cache as a whole (also when the load fails part way), so no lookup cached from the previous database survives the switch. A switch that fails keeps the previous `database_path` and database, the ones that define the held specifications."
msgstr "返回进程级规范参数管理器。首次调用在可重入锁下创建该实例，调用 `initialize()`，并据此刷新进程级变量名映射器；任一步失败时都会重置全局管理器并抛出异常。后续调用返回同一对象；若此前未预加载，后续带 `preload_all=True` 的调用会补执行预加载。此类延迟预加载仅采纳管理器尚未持有的键所对应的数据库规范；已持有的键（无论按需加载、显式注册或经由 `set_value` 写入）保留其既有规范、存储值与实时绑定。`initialize()` 本身不加载数据：以 `preload_all=True` 构造的管理器在构造函数返回时即持有完整数据库，且在 `initialize()` 之前写入的值或迁移的可学习绑定均予以保留。切换数据库（通过传入新 `database_path` 调用 `configure`）时，会按管理器的单位校验模式对新数据库的全部规范执行单位检查（仅检查模式记录问题，严格模式在采纳任何内容前直接抛出异常），随后用新数据库内容替换已持有的规范、存储值与绑定值，并整体清空查询缓存与单位换算缓存（中途加载失败时同样清空），确保旧数据库的任何缓存查询均不跨切换残留。切换失败时保留原有的 `database_path` 与数据库实例，使其继续与当前持有的规范一致。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:381
msgid "`reset_global_manager()`"
msgstr "`reset_global_manager()`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:387
