#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:390
msgid "Convenience accessors"
msgstr "便捷 accessor"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:423
msgid "These functions delegate to the process-wide manager from `get_global_manager()`. They are convenience entry points, not alternate managers. `get`, `set_value`, and `list_parameters` are exported by `relic.parameters`; `get_namespace_parameters` is imported from `relic.parameters.manager`."
msgstr "这些函数委派给 `get_global_manager()` 返回的进程级管理器，是便捷入口，不是替代管理器。`relic.parameters` 导出 `get`、`set_value` 和 `list_parameters`；`get_namespace_parameters` 从 `relic.parameters.manager` 导入。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:431
msgid "Implementation: `relic.parameters.spec.ParameterSpec`"
msgstr "实现：`relic.parameters.spec.ParameterSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:461
msgid "The displayed empty collections are produced by dataclass factories; instances do not share mutable defaults. `units`, `dtype`, `bounds`, and `category` have no default: a numeric `dtype` declares a `(lower, upper)` interval and writes an unbounded side as `-inf` or `inf` (`bounds=(-inf, inf)` is explicitly unbounded); `bounds=None` states that no interval applies and is accepted only for a non-numeric `dtype` (text, boolean switch, enumeration, list or mapping). `relic.parameters.spec.parameter_bounds_error(bounds, dtype)` is the one rule: `ParameterSpec` raises `ValueError` on a violation, and `has_complete_parameter_metadata`, the structural parameter audit and the parameter YAML schema read the same rule."
msgstr "所示空集合由 dataclass 工厂创建，实例之间不共享可变默认值。`units`、`dtype`、`bounds` 和 `category` 没有默认值：数值型 `dtype` 声明 `(lower, upper)` 区间，无界一侧写为 `-inf` 或 `inf`（`bounds=(-inf, inf)` 表示显式无界）；`bounds=None` 表示不适用区间，仅非数值型 `dtype`（文本、布尔开关、枚举、列表或映射）可以使用。`relic.parameters.spec.parameter_bounds_error(bounds, dtype)` 是唯一规则：违反时 `ParameterSpec` 抛出 `ValueError`，`has_complete_parameter_metadata`、结构参数审计和参数 YAML 模式也读取同一规则。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:473
msgid "A `list` or `tuple` dtype may declare one `[minimum, maximum]` pair of numbers per component in place of a single scalar interval, for example `[[223.15, 273.15], [323.15, 373.15]]` for a two-component value. `relic.parameters.spec.componentwise_bounds_errors(value, pairs)` is the one rule for such a declaration: the value is a list or tuple with one finite real component per pair, each inside its closed pair. `validate_value()` returns the violations, a validated `set_value(...)` and a validated `FunctorBase.get_parameter_value(...)` raise `ValueError`, and no component is clamped. A flat `(lower, upper)` interval on a list value is not applied to its components."
msgstr "`list` 或 `tuple` 类型的 dtype 可按分量逐一声明 `[minimum, maximum]` 数值区间对以替代单一标量区间，例如二分量参数可声明 `[[223.15, 273.15], [323.15, 373.15]]`。`relic.parameters.spec.componentwise_bounds_errors(value, pairs)` 是此类声明的唯一校验规则：参数值必须是与区间对等长的列表或元组，每个分量均为有限实数且落在对应闭区间内。越界时 `validate_value()` 返回违规列表，启用校验的 `set_value(...)` 与 `FunctorBase.get_parameter_value(...)` 均抛出 `ValueError`，不对任何分量执行截断。列表类型参数上的扁平 `(lower, upper)` 区间不逐分量套用。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:484
msgid "A numeric parameter declares its bounds endpoints, value, and default as numbers. `parameter_bounds_error` rejects textual numeric endpoints, and `ParameterSpec` rejects textual numeric values or defaults; neither is converted by `from_dict`. With PyYAML's YAML 1.1 rules, write `1.0e+7` or `1.0e-6`: `1.0e7` and `1e-6` are strings and are rejected."
msgstr "数值参数的边界端点、值和默认值都必须以数值声明。`parameter_bounds_error` 拒绝文本形式的数值端点，`ParameterSpec` 拒绝文本形式的数值或默认值；`from_dict` 均不执行转换。按 PyYAML 的 YAML 1.1 规则，应写 `1.0e+7` 或 `1.0e-6`；`1.0e7` 和 `1e-6` 会被解析为字符串并被拒绝。"

