#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:513
msgid "Returns validation messages without raising for ordinary invalid values. Checks include categorical membership, finite numeric values, scalar bounds, non-negative biological rates and concentrations, and physically valid absolute temperatures."
msgstr "对常规无效值返回校验消息而不抛出异常。检查项包括类别成员归属、有限数值、标量上下界、非负生物速率与浓度，以及物理有效的绝对温度。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:518
msgid "Tensor conversion"
msgstr "Tensor 转换"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:528
msgid "`to_tensor()` maps declared boolean, integer, and floating dtypes to PyTorch. String and categorical values raise `TypeError`. A non-floating Tensor cannot retain gradients; conversion failure raises `TypeError`."
msgstr "`to_tensor()` 将声明的 boolean、integer 和 floating dtype 映射到 PyTorch。String 和 categorical value 会抛出 `TypeError`。非 floating Tensor 无法保留 gradient；转换失败时抛出 `TypeError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:532
msgid "`from_tensor()` accepts only a scalar Tensor. A non-Tensor raises `TypeError`; a non-scalar Tensor raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "`from_tensor()` 只接受 scalar Tensor。非 Tensor 抛出 `TypeError`；非 scalar Tensor 抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:535
msgid "Mapping and serialization interface"
msgstr "Mapping 与序列化接口"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:537
msgid "`ParameterSpec` implements `Mapping[str, Any]` and provides:"
msgstr "`ParameterSpec` 实现 `Mapping[str, Any]`，并提供："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:545
msgid "`from_dict()` requires `value`, normalizes category, dtype, tags, bounds, and categorical values, and moves selected additional metadata into provenance."
msgstr "`from_dict()` 要求提供 `value`，会规范化 category、dtype、tags、bounds 和 categorical value，并将选定的附加 metadata 移入 provenance。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:548
msgid "`to_dict()` and `model_dump()` also emit `default`, in the same Tensor wire format as `value`, and `allowed_values`, as a list or `None`. `from_dict()` decodes a Tensor-encoded `default` and normalizes `allowed_values` to a list or `None`, so both fields round-trip."
msgstr "`to_dict()` 和 `model_dump()` 还输出 `default`，使用与 `value` 相同的张量传输格式；`allowed_values` 则输出为列表或 `None`。`from_dict()` 解码张量编码的 `default`，并将 `allowed_values` 规范化为列表或 `None`，使两个字段都能往返恢复。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:555
msgid "Implementation: `relic.parameters.serialization.ParameterSchema`"
msgstr "实现：`relic.parameters.serialization.ParameterSchema`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:558
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:626
msgid "Stable public import:"
msgstr "稳定公开导入："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:564
msgid "Status: stable serialization helper. It owns the parameter interchange envelope, not parameter lookup, per-entry metadata, or database persistence. The class has no constructor parameters and is intended as a namespace for its version and static methods."
msgstr "状态：稳定的 serialization helper。它拥有 parameter interchange envelope，但不拥有参数查找、per-entry metadata 或数据库持久化。该类没有构造参数，用作其版本和 static method 的 namespace。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:575
msgid "The canonical envelope has a `parameters` mapping. Each member is a mapping that contains at least `value`. `version`, `timestamp`, and `metadata` may accompany it."
msgstr "Canonical envelope 含有 `parameters` mapping。每个成员都是至少包含 `value` 的 mapping，还可带有 `version`、`timestamp` 和 `metadata`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:579
msgid "`validate_schema()`"
msgstr "`validate_schema()`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:587
msgid "Returns `True` only when:"
msgstr "仅在以下条件满足时返回 `True`："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:589
msgid "`data` contains `parameters`;"
msgstr "`data` 包含 `parameters`；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:590
msgid "`parameters` is a mapping;"
msgstr "`parameters` 是 mapping；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:591
msgid "every parameter entry is a mapping containing `value`."
msgstr "每个参数条目都是包含 `value` 的 mapping。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:593
msgid "It returns `False` for an incomplete canonical mapping. The current method is a lightweight structural check; it does not validate all `ParameterSpec` fields, units, bounds, or provenance. Inputs outside the declared mapping contract may raise ordinary Python type errors."
msgstr "对于不完整的 canonical mapping，返回 `False`。当前方法是轻量级结构检查；它不会验证所有 `ParameterSpec` field、单位、bounds 或 provenance。声明的 mapping contract 以外的输入可能抛出普通 Python type error。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:598
msgid "`migrate_schema()`"
msgstr "`migrate_schema()`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:607
msgid "Returns a shallow copy of a canonical mapping and adds `ParameterSchema.VERSION` when `version` is absent."
msgstr "返回 canonical mapping 的 shallow copy；缺少 `version` 时添加 `ParameterSchema.VERSION`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:610
msgid "Raises `ValueError` when `data` is not a mapping, when `parameters` is not a mapping, or when the canonical `parameters` field is missing."
msgstr "当 `data` 不是 mapping、`parameters` 不是 mapping，或缺少 canonical `parameters` field 时抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:613
msgid "Current implementation limits:"
msgstr "当前实现限制："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:615
msgid "Flat legacy parameter maps are rejected without migration."
msgstr "扁平旧版参数映射直接拒绝，不执行迁移。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:616
msgid "`from_version` is accepted by the signature but does not currently select a version-specific migration path."
msgstr "Signature 接受 `from_version`，但当前不会据此选择 version-specific migration path。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:618
msgid "`ParameterSchema` must not be treated as a second `ParameterSpec` schema or validation registry."
msgstr "不得将 `ParameterSchema` 视为第二套 `ParameterSpec` schema 或 validation registry。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:623
msgid "Implementation: `relic.parameters.decorators.ParameterDefinition`"
msgstr "实现：`relic.parameters.decorators.ParameterDefinition`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:632
msgid "Status: exported compatibility and convenience metadata for the parameter decorator API. It is not the canonical runtime parameter object and must not replace `ParameterSpec`."
msgstr "状态：parameter decorator API 导出的兼容和便捷 metadata。它不是 canonical runtime parameter object，也不得替代 `ParameterSpec`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`name`"
msgstr "`name`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Parameter name attached to a decorated property."
msgstr "附加到 decorated property 的参数名称。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Local fallback used by the decorator."
msgstr "Decorator 使用的本地 fallback。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Declared physical units (required; there is no universal unit)."
msgstr "声明的物理单位（必填；不存在通用单位）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Lower and upper limits passed to decorator-managed access (required; `(-inf, inf)` declares an unbounded parameter)."
msgstr "传给装饰器管理访问的下限和上限（必填；`(-inf, inf)` 声明无界参数）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Human-readable meaning."
msgstr "便于阅读的含义。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Request a trainable value when decorator registration is used."
msgstr "使用 decorator registration 时，请求 trainable value。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`validate`"
msgstr "`validate`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Request decorator-time validation."
msgstr "请求 decorator-time validation。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`register`"
msgstr "`register`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Request registration of a missing decorated parameter."
msgstr "请求注册缺失的 decorated parameter。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:660
msgid "The dataclass has no validation methods or `__post_init__`. Invalid names, bounds, units, or defaults are not rejected at construction and can fail only when the owning decorator or manager uses them."
msgstr "该 dataclass 没有 validation method 或 `__post_init__`。无效的名称、bounds、单位或 default 不会在构造时被拒绝，只会在 owning decorator 或 manager 使用它们时失败。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:664
msgid "The decorators `managed_parameters`, `parameter`, `validated_parameter`, and `learnable_parameter` attach or consume this metadata. `managed_parameters` registers only an attribute `<name>` that declares a complete `<name>_spec` mapping (`units`, `bounds`, `dtype`, and `description`); an incomplete spec raises `ValueError`, and an attribute without a spec is not a managed parameter. They remain exported, but production scientific Functors must use YAML-backed `ParameterSpec` entries and `self.get_parameter_value(...)`. A decorated property is not an alternative parameter owner or an approved way to hardcode scientific defaults."
msgstr "装饰器 `managed_parameters`、`parameter`、`validated_parameter` 和 `learnable_parameter` 附加或使用这些元数据。`managed_parameters` 仅注册声明了完整 `<name>_spec` 映射的属性 `<name>`（包含 `units`、`bounds`、`dtype` 和 `description`）；规范不完整时抛出 `ValueError`，没有规范的属性不是受管理参数。这些装饰器仍然导出，但生产科学 Functor 必须使用由 YAML 支持的 `ParameterSpec` 条目和 `self.get_parameter_value(...)`。装饰后的属性不是替代参数所有者，也不是获准硬编码科学默认值的方式。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:675
msgid "Manager-owned support classes"
msgstr "Manager-owned support classes（由 Manager 管理的支持类）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:686
msgid "The database owns two precedence tiers:"
msgstr "数据库拥有两个 precedence tier："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:688
msgid "`relic`: native framework parameters."
msgstr "`relic`：native framework parameter（框架原生参数）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:689
msgid "`calibrated`: calibration and optimized values."
msgstr "`calibrated`：calibration 和 optimized value。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:691
msgid "Construction creates the `relic` and `calibrated` tier directories under `base_path` and initializes an empty parameter cache and a per-file header cache; it builds no file index. Every read follows one load plan:"
msgstr "构造时在 `base_path` 下创建 `relic` 和 `calibrated` 层级目录，并初始化空参数缓存和逐文件头部缓存；不建立文件索引。每次读取都遵循唯一加载计划："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:695
msgid "the native `relic` files (the base tier);"
msgstr "原生 `relic` 文件（基础层）；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:696
msgid "the enabled calibrated scopes `global`, `regional`, and `site_specific`, in that order (`RELIC_CALIBRATED_SCALES` selects scopes, top-level calibrated snapshot files take part only with `RELIC_INCLUDE_CALIBRATED_SNAPSHOTS=1`, and `RELIC_SKIP_CALIBRATED=1` excludes the calibrated tier);"
msgstr "依次加载已启用的校准范围 `global`、`regional` 和 `site_specific`（由 `RELIC_CALIBRATED_SCALES` 选择范围；仅设置 `RELIC_INCLUDE_CALIBRATED_SNAPSHOTS=1` 时顶层校准快照文件才参与，`RELIC_SKIP_CALIBRATED=1` 则排除校准层）；"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:700
msgid "the sources added with `add_source()`."
msgstr "通过 `add_source()` 添加的数据源。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:702
msgid "Later entries take precedence, and a key defined in two base-tier files raises `ValueError` naming both files. The namespace of a YAML file is its top-level `namespace:` header line, read from the raw bytes and cached by modification time and size; file and directory names play no role. JSON files and YAML files without that header are read only by the full loads. Primary methods include:"
msgstr "后加载的条目优先。同一键在两个基础层文件中定义时，会抛出 `ValueError` 并指出两个文件。YAML 文件的命名空间由顶层 `namespace:` 头部行声明，从原始字节读取，并按修改时间和大小缓存；文件名和目录名不参与判断。JSON 文件和缺少该头部的 YAML 文件仅在完整加载时读取。主要方法包括："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:727
msgid "`get_parameter(key)` returns a cached specification directly. Otherwise it loads the files whose declared namespace is a dot prefix of the key, together with every file of a related (ancestor or descendant) namespace, in full-load precedence. If that does not define the key, it runs `load_all()`; with `fail_on_validation_errors` set, it raises `KeyError` instead. That flag comes from `RELIC_FAIL_ON_PARAMETER_VALIDATION` (`1`, `true`, or `yes`) or, when that variable is unset, from a true `CI` variable or a `RELIC_ENV` of `ci`, `prod`, or `production`."
msgstr "`get_parameter(key)` 直接返回已缓存规范。未缓存时，按完整加载的优先顺序读取已声明命名空间是该键点分前缀的文件，以及所有相关命名空间（祖先或后代）的文件。若仍未定义该键，则执行 `load_all()`；设置 `fail_on_validation_errors` 时改为抛出 `KeyError`。该标志取自 `RELIC_FAIL_ON_PARAMETER_VALIDATION`（`1`、`true` 或 `yes`）；该变量未设置时，则由为真的 `CI` 变量或取 `ci`、`prod`、`production` 的 `RELIC_ENV` 决定。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:737
msgid "`load_namespace(namespace)` reads the files of related namespaces in the same way, `declares_namespace(namespace)` reports whether a participating file declares the namespace, an ancestor, or a descendant, and `declared_namespaces()` lists the declared namespaces in load order. `load_all_with_priority(source_priority)` accepts only `relic` and `calibrated`, highest precedence first, reads those tiers of the load plan without the additional sources, raises `ValueError` for any other name, and leaves the cache unchanged. `add_source()` raises `FileNotFoundError` for a path that does not exist."
msgstr "`load_namespace(namespace)` 以相同方式读取相关命名空间的文件；`declares_namespace(namespace)` 报告参与加载的文件是否声明该命名空间、其祖先或后代；`declared_namespaces()` 按加载顺序列出已声明命名空间。`load_all_with_priority(source_priority)` 仅接受 `relic` 和 `calibrated`，最高优先级在前，只读取加载计划中的这些层而不读取附加数据源；其他名称会引发 `ValueError`，且缓存保持不变。`add_source()` 对不存在的路径抛出 `FileNotFoundError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:747
msgid "Application code normally reaches this object through `UnifiedParameterManager.database`. Direct construction is appropriate only for controlled infrastructure that intentionally owns a database root."
msgstr "应用代码通常通过 `UnifiedParameterManager.database` 访问此对象。只有明确拥有某个 database root 的受控基础设施才适合直接构造它。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:757
msgid "Provides thread-safe in-memory CRUD, namespace indexing, access statistics, and immutable snapshots."
msgstr "提供线程安全的 in-memory CRUD、namespace 索引、访问统计和 immutable snapshot。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:772
msgid "`storage.list(namespace=...)` returns every key below `\"<namespace>.\"` (children and deeper descendants) with one rule for every namespace; a key of a sibling prefix (`a.bc.x` for namespace `a.b`) is never returned."
msgstr "`storage.list(namespace=...)` 对每个命名空间都按同一规则返回 `\"<namespace>.\"` 下的全部键（直接子项和更深后代）；绝不返回同级前缀的键，例如命名空间 `a.b` 不会返回 `a.bc.x`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:776
msgid "`UnifiedParameterManager.delete(key)` removes the specification, the storage value and any registered `nn.Parameter`, then clears the query cache and the unit-conversion cache as a whole, so no cached lookup of the deleted key or of its namespace/unit variants survives the deletion. `storage.snapshot()` captures the stored values, or the explicit `parameters` values without changing live storage, each with its type and dtype; `metadata` is recorded with the snapshot. `storage.restore(snapshot)` replaces the stored values and then notifies the manager. The manager requires a specification for every restored value, the loaded one or the database one; a value without any specification raises `KeyError`, and no specification is invented. It brings specification values and live bindings in line with the restored values and drops the specifications and bindings of parameters absent from the snapshot. When a restore callback raises, its error propagates and the storage takes back the values it held before the restore. `manager.restore(snapshot)` writes the stored values directly and sets the snapshotted specifications exactly itself."
msgstr "`UnifiedParameterManager.delete(key)` 移除规范、存储值和已注册的 `nn.Parameter`，随后整体清空查询缓存和单位转换缓存，因此已删除键及其命名空间或单位变体不会残留缓存查询结果。`storage.snapshot()` 捕获存储值，或在不改变实时存储的前提下捕获显式给出的 `parameters` 值，并保留每个值的类型和 dtype；`metadata` 与快照一起记录。`storage.restore(snapshot)` 替换存储值，然后通知管理器。管理器要求每个恢复值都有已加载或数据库提供的规范；没有任何规范的值会引发 `KeyError`，绝不虚构规范。管理器使规范值和实时绑定与恢复值一致，并移除快照中不存在参数的规范和绑定。恢复回调抛出异常时，错误会传播，存储层恢复到恢复操作前持有的值。`manager.restore(snapshot)` 则直接写入存储值，并自行精确设置快照中的规范。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:793
msgid "This is the manager's value layer, not a public alternative to `UnifiedParameterManager`."
msgstr "这是 manager 的 value layer，不是 `UnifiedParameterManager` 的公开替代品。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:807
msgid "The frozen dataclass deep-copies its values and metadata. The `parameters` property returns a read-only `MappingProxyType`. A manager snapshot records the live learnable values under `metadata[\"nn_values\"]`."
msgstr "该冻结 dataclass 对值和元数据进行深复制。`parameters` 属性返回只读 `MappingProxyType`。管理器快照在 `metadata[\"nn_values\"]` 下记录实时可学习值。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:835
msgid "Validation levels:"
msgstr "验证级别："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:837
msgid "`NONE`: no validation."
msgstr "`NONE`：不验证。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:838
msgid "`BASIC`: type and range checks."
msgstr "`BASIC`：类型和范围检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:839
msgid "`STANDARD`: standard scientific and relationship checks."
msgstr "`STANDARD`：标准科学检查和关系检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:840
msgid "`STRICT`: full checks with strict context."
msgstr "`STRICT`：使用 strict context 的完整检查。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:841
msgid "`CUSTOM`: caller-defined policy."
msgstr "`CUSTOM`：caller-defined policy（调用方定义的策略）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:843
msgid "`ParameterValidationResult` contains `is_valid`, `errors`, `warnings`, `level`, and machine-readable `error_types`. `ParameterValidationContext` contains related parameter values, environmental context, `strict_mode`, and `warnings_as_errors`."
msgstr "`ParameterValidationResult` 包含 `is_valid`、`errors`、`warnings`、`level` 和 machine-readable `error_types`。`ParameterValidationContext` 包含相关参数值、environmental context、`strict_mode` 和 `warnings_as_errors`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:848
msgid "`ParameterValidationResult`"
msgstr "`ParameterValidationResult`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:859
msgid "The result reports validation status without requiring an exception. `aggregate(results)` combines errors, warnings, error categories, and joint validity across multiple results."
msgstr "该结果对象直接报告校验状态而无需抛出异常。`aggregate(results)` 汇总多个结果中的错误、警告、错误类别与联合有效性。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:863
msgid "`ParameterValidationContext`"
msgstr "`ParameterValidationContext`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:874
msgid "The context supplies related values and environmental information to cross-parameter and scientific validators. Strict validation enables `strict_mode` and treats warnings as errors."
msgstr "该 context 向 cross-parameter validator 和 scientific validator 提供相关值及环境信息。Strict validation 会启用 `strict_mode`，并将 warning 作为 error。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:878
msgid "`BoundsPolicy` and `UnitValidationMode`"
msgstr "`BoundsPolicy` 与 `UnitValidationMode`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:880
msgid "`BoundsPolicy` selects `WARN_AND_CLAMP` or `ERROR`. `UnitValidationMode` selects `OFF`, `CHECK_ONLY`, or `STRICT`."
msgstr "`BoundsPolicy` 选择 `WARN_AND_CLAMP` 或 `ERROR`。`UnitValidationMode` 选择 `OFF`、`CHECK_ONLY` 或 `STRICT`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:883
msgid "Physical constraint integration"
msgstr "物理约束集成"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:885
#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1052
msgid "Stability and ownership"
msgstr "稳定性与所有权"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:887
msgid "`PhysicalConstraintManager`, `ConstraintSpec`, and `ConstraintType` are defined in:"
msgstr "`PhysicalConstraintManager`、`ConstraintSpec` 和 `ConstraintType` 定义在："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:894
msgid "They are not exported by `relic.coupling.scales` or `relic.coupling`. Their direct module path is the canonical infrastructure integration path, not a general package-root public API."
msgstr "它们不会由 `relic.coupling.scales` 或 `relic.coupling` 导出。其直接模块路径是 canonical infrastructure integration path，而不是一般的 package-root public API。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:898
msgid "Each `StateManager` owns its physical-constraint manager. It first uses an explicit `physical_constraint_manager=` constructor injection; otherwise its read-only `physical_constraint_manager` property lazily constructs, initializes, validates, and caches one instance for that StateManager:"
msgstr "每个 `StateManager` 拥有自己的 physical-constraint manager。它优先使用显式的 `physical_constraint_manager=` 构造函数注入；否则，其只读 `physical_constraint_manager` property 会为该 StateManager 延迟构造、初始化、验证并缓存一个实例："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:911
msgid "There is no module-global physical-constraint getter or setter. Scientific Functors propose their state updates through the existing contract and do not create competing constraint owners. Infrastructure that needs explicit construction uses the same class and its normal lifecycle."
msgstr "不存在 module 全局的 physical-constraint getter 或 setter。科学 Functor 通过现有 contract 提出其状态更新，不会创建相互竞争的 constraint owner。需要显式构造的基础设施使用同一个 class 及其正常生命周期。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:916
msgid "`ConstraintSpec`"
msgstr "`ConstraintSpec`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Constraint identity used for filtering and diagnostics."
msgstr "用于过滤和 diagnostics 的 constraint identity。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`type`"
msgstr "`type`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Constraint operation selected from `ConstraintType`."
msgstr "从 `ConstraintType` 选择的 constraint operation。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`min_value`"
msgstr "`min_value`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Optional lower bound for `BOUNDED`."
msgstr "`BOUNDED` 的可选 lower bound。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`max_value`"
msgstr "`max_value`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Optional upper bound for `BOUNDED`."
msgstr "`BOUNDED` 的可选 upper bound。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`smoothness`"
msgstr "`smoothness`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Optional smoothing scale used by `SMOOTH`."
msgstr "`SMOOTH` 使用的可选 smoothing scale。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`strict`"
msgstr "`strict`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Declared strictness flag carried by the specification."
msgstr "Specification 携带的 declared strictness flag。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Optional provenance and variable context."
msgstr "可选的 provenance 和 variable context。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:940
msgid "`ConstraintType` defines `NON_NEGATIVE`, `BOUNDED`, `MONOTONIC`, `CONVEX`, `SMOOTH`, and `CONSERVE_SHAPE`."
msgstr "`ConstraintType` 定义 `NON_NEGATIVE`、`BOUNDED`、`MONOTONIC`、`CONVEX`、`SMOOTH` 和 `CONSERVE_SHAPE`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:943
msgid "`ConstraintSpec` parses `type` at construction: a `ConstraintType` or its value string; another value raises `ValueError` naming the types. The manager's validation phase reports a bounded specification with no limits or with `min_value >= max_value`. `add_constraint` takes only a `ConstraintSpec` with a known type, and a type changed after the constraint was added raises `ValueError` when the constraints are applied; no constraint is skipped."
msgstr "`ConstraintSpec` 在构造时解析 `type`，接受 `ConstraintType` 或对应的值字符串；其他值引发 `ValueError`，并列出类型。管理器在验证阶段报告未提供上下限或满足 `min_value >= max_value` 的有界规范。`add_constraint` 仅接受类型已知的 `ConstraintSpec`；添加约束后再改变类型，会在应用约束时引发 `ValueError`，不跳过任何约束。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`constraints`"
msgstr "`constraints`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Initial constraint specifications (`ConstraintSpec` entries; another entry raises `ValueError`). `initialize()` copies them, so constraints added later do not survive `reset()` and the next `initialize()`."
msgstr "初始约束规范（`ConstraintSpec` 条目；其他条目引发 `ValueError`）。`initialize()` 复制这些条目，因此之后添加的约束不会在 `reset()` 和下一次 `initialize()` 后保留。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`method`"
msgstr "`method`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Application strategy, one of the `allowed_values` of `coupling.scales.defaults.physical_constraint_method` (`clip`, `scale`, `redistribute`, `project`); another value raises `ValueError` naming them, at construction and at `configure` (a rejected call changes nothing)."
msgstr "应用策略，取 `coupling.scales.defaults.physical_constraint_method` 的 `allowed_values` 之一（`clip`、`scale`、`redistribute`、`project`）；构造或 `configure` 时传入其他值会引发 `ValueError` 并列出允许值（被拒绝的调用不改变任何内容）。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`preserve_gradients`"
msgstr "`preserve_gradients`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Clone data while preserving autograd connectivity without detaching tensors. With the `clip` method, clipped elements still receive zero gradient through `torch.clamp`. `True` or `False` (another value raises `ValueError`); `None` takes the parameter."
msgstr "克隆数据时保留自动微分计算图连接，不分离张量。采用 `clip` 方法时，被裁剪元素经由 `torch.clamp` 获得的梯度仍为零。取值为 `True` 或 `False`（传入其他值抛出 `ValueError`）；设为 `None` 时读取参数配置。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`device`"
msgstr "`device`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Device for manager operations and adaptive parameters."
msgstr "Manager operation 和 adaptive parameter 使用的 device。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`parameter_manager`"
msgstr "`parameter_manager`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Explicit parameter owner used by initialization; the canonical global parameter owner is resolved only when this is absent."
msgstr "初始化所使用的显式参数 owner；仅当其缺失时才解析 canonical 全局参数 owner。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:970
msgid "Direct construction creates an uninitialized `BaseManager`/`nn.Module`. Infrastructure calls `initialize()` and `validate()`. Normal state updates obtain the initialized, cached owner through `state_manager.physical_constraint_manager`."
msgstr "直接构造会创建未初始化的 `BaseManager`/`nn.Module`。基础设施调用 `initialize()` 和 `validate()`。正常的状态更新通过 `state_manager.physical_constraint_manager` 获取已初始化并缓存的 owner。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:975
msgid "When explicit settings are omitted, initialization resolves `physical_constraint_method`, `preserve_gradients`, and `constraint_device` from `coupling.scales.defaults` through the canonical parameter manager. Missing required parameter values propagate lookup errors, and a `physical_constraint_method` parameter outside its `allowed_values` raises `ValueError` naming them; `initialize()` reports such a failure, like every initialization failure, as `ManagerInitializationError` with the error as its cause and leaves the manager in the `ERROR` state. The constraint operations never treat an unknown method as `clip`: they raise `ValueError`. If neither a manager nor all explicit settings are available, initialization raises `RuntimeError`, reported the same way."
msgstr "省略显式设置时，初始化通过权威参数管理器，从 `coupling.scales.defaults` 解析 `physical_constraint_method`、`preserve_gradients` 和 `constraint_device`。缺少必需参数值时传播查询错误，`physical_constraint_method` 超出其 `allowed_values` 时抛出 `ValueError` 并列出允许值；`initialize()` 与处理其他初始化失败相同，将该失败报告为 `ManagerInitializationError`，保留原错误作为原因，并将管理器置于 `ERROR` 状态。约束操作绝不将未知方法当作 `clip`，而是抛出 `ValueError`。如果既没有管理器，也未提供全部显式设置，初始化会抛出 `RuntimeError`，并按同样方式报告。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:987
msgid "An explicitly injected `parameter_manager` controls initialization and subsequent parameter lookups. Only when it is absent does `_do_initialize()` obtain the canonical `get_global_manager()`."
msgstr "显式注入的 `parameter_manager` 控制初始化及后续参数查找。仅当其缺失时，`_do_initialize()` 才获取 canonical 的 `get_global_manager()`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:991
msgid "Constraint operations"
msgstr "约束操作"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`data`"
msgstr "`data`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Tensor to constrain."
msgstr "要约束的 Tensor。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`constraint_names`"
msgstr "`constraint_names`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Optional subset of registered constraint names."
msgstr "已注册 constraint name 的可选子集。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`return_mask`"
msgstr "`return_mask`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Return a boolean violation mask with the constrained Tensor."
msgstr "随 constrained Tensor 返回 boolean violation mask。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Runtime lower and upper limits used to create a temporary bounded constraint."
msgstr "用于创建临时 bounded constraint 的 runtime lower 和 upper limit。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`variable_name`"
msgstr "`variable_name`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Variable identity for the catalog bounds lookup and diagnostics."
msgstr "用于目录边界查询和诊断的变量标识。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "`scale`"
msgstr "`scale`"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:10
msgid "Optional scale namespace used during bounds lookup."
msgstr "Bounds lookup 期间使用的可选 scale namespace。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1020
msgid "If `bounds` is absent and `variable_name` is present, the bounds are the `bounds` field of the variable's scale-catalog entry (`coupling.scales.<scale>.variables`, then `coupling.scales.defaults.variables`, matched like every catalog lookup); a variable that no catalog declares, or an entry without a `bounds` field, raises `KeyError`, and `bounds: null` means no bound. No other namespace, `<name>_bounds` key or clamp key is consulted. The `ScaleManager` facade passes the bounds of the variable's resolved metadata (call metadata, else its catalog entry) and asks for no lookup when that declaration has none. It records violations but does not create another state or conservation owner. Calling this method before manager initialization can fail because runtime attributes are not available. Tensor shape and operator errors propagate from PyTorch."
msgstr "未提供 `bounds` 但提供 `variable_name` 时，边界取自该变量尺度目录条目的 `bounds` 字段（先 `coupling.scales.<scale>.variables`，再 `coupling.scales.defaults.variables`，匹配规则与其他目录查询相同）；没有目录声明该变量，或条目缺少 `bounds` 字段时，抛出 `KeyError`；`bounds: null` 表示无边界。不查询其他命名空间、`<name>_bounds` 键或裁剪键。`ScaleManager` 外观传入解析后变量元数据中的边界（优先调用元数据，其次目录条目）；声明无边界时不请求查询。它记录违反项，但不创建第二个状态或守恒所有者。管理器初始化前调用该方法可能因运行时属性尚不可用而失败。张量形状和算子错误由 PyTorch 传播。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1038
msgid "The report contains total violations, check count, violation rate, and up to the ten most recent history entries."
msgstr "报告包含 violation 总数、检查次数、violation rate，以及最近最多十条历史记录。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1041
msgid "`configure` accepts only `method`, `preserve_gradients`, `device` and `constraints`: an unknown key, an invalid method, a `preserve_gradients` that is not `True` or `False`, a `device` that is not a torch device, and `constraints` that are not a list of mappings of `ConstraintSpec` fields (with `name` and `type`, a known type and no other field) raise `ValueError` before the call changes anything. Manager `validate()` reports invalid methods, unavailable CUDA devices, and malformed bounded constraints through the BaseManager validation result."
msgstr "`configure` 仅接受 `method`、`preserve_gradients`、`device` 和 `constraints`：未知键、无效方法、既非 `True` 也非 `False` 的 `preserve_gradients`、不是 torch 设备的 `device`，或并非 `ConstraintSpec` 字段映射列表的 `constraints`（须包含 `name` 和 `type`、类型已知且无其他字段），都会在改变任何内容之前引发 `ValueError`。管理器的 `validate()` 通过 BaseManager 验证结果报告无效方法、不可用 CUDA 设备以及格式错误的有界约束。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1050
msgid "Conservation guardian"
msgstr "Conservation guardian（守恒守护器）"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1054
msgid "`ConservationGuardian` is the canonical fourth-layer domain budget checker named by the architecture, but it is not re-exported from `relic.validation`. Use the direct module path only for validation infrastructure:"
msgstr "`ConservationGuardian` 是架构中命名的 canonical 第四层 domain budget checker，但不会从 `relic.validation` 重新导出。仅 validation infrastructure 应使用直接模块路径："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1066
msgid "`StateManager` owns commit-time state ledgers and invokes the guardian through its conservation integration. `ConservationGuardian` is a non-blocking diagnostic checker; it is not another StateManager, ledger, generic validation result, or scientific process."
msgstr "`StateManager` 拥有 commit-time state ledger，并通过其 conservation integration 调用 guardian。`ConservationGuardian` 是非阻塞 diagnostic checker；它不是另一个 StateManager、ledger、generic validation result 或 scientific process。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1071
msgid "`BudgetCheckResult`"
msgstr "`BudgetCheckResult`"

