#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1119
msgid "The constructor converts tolerances to `float`; incompatible values raise `TypeError` or `ValueError`. It does not currently enforce non-negative or finite tolerances."
msgstr "构造函数将 tolerance 转换为 `float`；不兼容的值会抛出 `TypeError` 或 `ValueError`。当前不强制 tolerance 为非负或有限值。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1135
msgid "The domain balance is:"
msgstr "Domain balance 为："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1137
msgid ""
"\n"
"\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{expected}}\n"
"= \\left(\\sum F_{\\mathrm{in}} - \\sum F_{\\mathrm{out}}\\right) \\Delta t.\n"
msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{expected}}\n"
"= \\left(\\sum F_{\\mathrm{in}} - \\sum F_{\\mathrm{out}}\\right) \\Delta t.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1142
msgid "The threshold is:"
msgstr "Threshold 为："

