msgstr ""
"\n"
"\\tau\n"
"= \\mathrm{atol}\n"
"+ \\mathrm{rtol}\n"
"  \\lvert\\Delta S_{\\mathrm{expected}}\\rvert.\n"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1151
msgid "A failed budget logs an error and returns `passed=False`; it does not raise merely because the budget failed. Registry, conversion, or Tensor failures can still propagate. `check_domain()` does not populate `invariant_drift`; that diagnostic is computed separately."
msgstr "Budget 失败时会记录 error 并返回 `passed=False`；不会仅因 budget 失败而抛出异常。Registry、转换或 Tensor failure 仍可能传播。`check_domain()` 不填充 `invariant_drift`；该 diagnostic 会单独计算。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1167
msgid "Returns zero for an empty coefficient row or empty flux vector. Otherwise the coefficient count must equal the number of flux entries; a mismatch raises `ValueError`."
msgstr "对于空 coefficient row 或空 flux vector，返回零。否则 coefficient 数量必须等于 flux entry 数量；不匹配时抛出 `ValueError`。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1171
msgid "Scientific modules must not reproduce these tolerance and budget loops in their `forward()` methods. Local checks remain owned by `FunctorBase`, commit-time ledgers by `StateManager`, and domain diagnostics by `ConservationGuardian`."
msgstr "Scientific module 不得在其 `forward()` method 中重复实现这些 tolerance 和 budget loop。Local check 仍由 `FunctorBase` 所有，commit-time ledger 由 `StateManager` 所有，domain diagnostic 由 `ConservationGuardian` 所有。"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1176
msgid "Physical constants and anti-redundancy rules"
msgstr "物理常数与 anti-redundancy 规则"

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1178
msgid "Physical constants have one database owner:"
msgstr "物理常数只有一个 database owner："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1184
msgid "Non-Functor infrastructure reads them through:"
msgstr "Non-Functor infrastructure 通过以下入口读取它们："

#: <RELIC_ROOT>/docs/source/public/api/parameters_contracts.md:1193
msgid "Do not duplicate physical constants in Python or domain parameter files. Do not add another manager, parameter accessor, cache, database facade, or compatibility wrapper. In particular, removed access chains such as `get_parameter_by_path()`, `_require_parameter()`, `require_parameter_value()`, and `ParameterAccessorMixin` are not part of the public architecture."
msgstr "不要在 Python 或 domain parameter file 中重复定义 physical constant。不要添加另一个 manager、parameter accessor、cache、database facade 或 compatibility wrapper。特别是，已移除的 access chain（例如 `get_parameter_by_path()`、`_require_parameter()`、`require_parameter_value()` 和 `ParameterAccessorMixin`）不属于 public architecture。"

